      "name": "Is there a cheaper way to get a Private Pilot certificate if I'm on a budget?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "The Sport Pilot certificate can be cheaper because the minimum training requirement is lower and the mission is narrower. The hourly airplane rate is not automatically cheaper at current local Bristell rates. Sport Pilot limits you to one passenger and specific aircraft types. It can be a legitimate first target for recreational flying." }
