      "name": "How much does a Private Pilot certificate cost in Louisville, KY?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "For a student flying out of Bowman Field (KLOU) in 2026, a safer Private Pilot certificate budget is about $18,000 to $24,000 all-in, depending on total hours flown, aircraft type, instructor rate, and gear purchases. Use roughly 75 hours for conservative national-average planning." }
    }
